{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "9d8ad907479c61296f68dc7b6c57ba7bddd32dbc0a5f99d8571843867435277a", "ja": "その日は、私たちの運命が動き出した日……。", "zh": "那一天，是我们的命运开始转动的日子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "fce9993cb32f1af3eaa79299c800a9ec53e107db2348e5a7d5b944770244f7a6", "ja": "アイドル事務所『765プロダクション』の大型企画、\n39プロジェクト。その新人アイドルに選ばれて半年。", "zh": "偶像事务所“765制作”的大型企划，39企划。自被选为该企划的新人偶像以来，已经过去半年了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "5c961d454d12409585ebc0129fba3accd273ae7f1d5f6aa562a4b220223a9571", "ja": "私たちは訓練生としてレッスンに励みながら、なかなか\n始まらないプロジェクトに不安を募らせていました。", "zh": "我们一边作为训练生努力参加课程，一边对迟迟未能启动的项目愈发感到不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "5754a8dc7d4348aad699849954a92d5487b32f9d91da997b85dabdd920cb1dda", "ja": "そんなある日……。このみさん、桃子ちゃん、\n私の3人は、突然劇場へと集められたのです。", "zh": "就在某一天……我和木实姐、桃子，我们3个人突然被召集到了剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1004_407bnp", "source_sha256": "44bea1177b78c2061dfd06b406f8bbbd2954b4947a308b03d6f00aa47842fa5c", "ja": "おはようみんな！\n急だったけど集まってくれてありがとう。", "zh": "早上好，大家！\n虽然很突然，但还是谢谢你们赶过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "5f8fbfe5afbd8be22cc45ed2421107ba34e424701fd74be5b97dbf1c7f47c062", "ja": "……もう、遅いよお兄ちゃん。\nいつまで待たせるつもり？", "zh": "……真是的，太慢了大哥哥。\n打算让人家等到什么时候？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1006_407bnp", "source_sha256": "9a21b471fe83cccc79cf16d33445af5a8032354bac39dff42d126906fa19a762", "ja": "ごめんごめん。色々立て込んでてさ。\n……とりあえず、みんなにひとつ報告がある。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，最近各种事情都赶到一起了。  \n……总之，有一件事要告诉大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1007_407bnp", "source_sha256": "e6c0216f94be30b45b3d688cf96287e88b9e1519aa439863fffeabc8b43e3653", "ja": "新しく5人のアイドルが正式に765プロに加わって、\n39プロジェクトにアイドルが揃ったんだよ。", "zh": "新加入的5名偶像正式加入了765事务所，39企划的偶像就到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "c4d9135f7a6eeb0f66586a2446cac0144f9b5549bf0293076791914659b06d6b", "ja": "そ、それじゃあ……！", "zh": "那、那也就是说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1009_407bnp", "source_sha256": "681ce373f08c3183bc5ee2631eb7559fbc88d0e8bf10afb863fb7abd95b52ad8", "ja": "うん。これで39プロジェクト本格始動だ！\n君たちはアイドルになる！", "zh": "嗯。这样一来39企划就正式启动了！\n你们要成为偶像了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "3137c3da794a8a702bf0060b0991fbb5ff6c58e9f3a73f9851b27385653119d8", "ja": "わ、私……。\n本当に……私がアイドルに……！", "zh": "我、我……  \n真的……我也能成为偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "c924f563be5a8de7c12504ebb61186d6efddb823e59fcd031d27d360d14abbe2", "ja": "……でもお兄ちゃん。どうしてわざわざ\n桃子たちだけ先に集めて報告するの？", "zh": "……可是，哥哥。为什么要特意先把桃子她们叫到一起，向我们报告呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1012_407bnp", "source_sha256": "89f92101aadf4bb3ee7f77f38c1611b802bb70b002d679d358c04ca695fdf1c1", "ja": "うん、それなんだけど……今日3人に集まって\nもらったのは、少し先の話もしておきたくてね。", "zh": "嗯，其实是这样的……今天把你们3个人\n召集过来，也是想和你们聊聊稍微之后一点的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1013_407bnp", "source_sha256": "9f668dbf7b7cda0b02770e89686233935d9c7d2049ff5b4d33979ef5a81bf731", "ja": "劇場オープン後しばらくしたら、少人数のチームを\n作って売り出していく、という企画も考えていてな……", "zh": "剧场开张一段时间后，我还在考虑推出组建小规模团队进行宣传这样的企划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "2500ca4959bcf3ffb9ce4a2a17e4ebd6eb040ce2bd5f5c4a86bb9e6a24a6c76f", "ja": "初めて見る資料ね。\nこれって要するに……アイドルユニットってこと？", "zh": "这是第一次看到的资料呢。\n也就是说……是偶像组合吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1015_407bnp", "source_sha256": "286009b89e2dae546d6096daf7e0724cdba90fe16007a3fd9a53b56d500586f8", "ja": "そうですそうです！　ずっと固定ではないんですが、\n一つの方針としてですね。", "zh": "对，就是这样！虽然并不是一直固定不变，但可以作为一种方针。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1016_407bnp", "source_sha256": "cc713cea83006fa29897146656613009b3e490b409a03edf683e3452d2db50d7", "ja": "だけど、今の段階ではチームの相性も\nファンの反応もまだまだ未知数。", "zh": "不过，目前这个阶段，无论是团队的默契，还是粉丝的反应，都还是未知数。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "b705242da4423b1f5150c342941ff731e96c9b6811598b0cc263ffc413e0d293", "ja": "ふーん……。", "zh": "哼——……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1018_407bnp", "source_sha256": "208367492de73ad2b0e0f74ec8edc8c1a5ed0dfa9684055e22a0e08f52024181", "ja": "そこでまず、劇場オープンの際に行われるこけら落とし\n公演に向けて、一度チームを組ませてみたいんだ。", "zh": "所以首先，我想让你们组一次队，为剧场开幕时举行的首场演出做准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1021_407bnp", "source_sha256": "2bbac4f18d388b3243ee4abfce17e17d1082e48099eb332718531d486caafc2a", "ja": "……このみさん、桃子、そして百合子。", "zh": "……木实小姐、桃子，还有百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1022_407bnp", "source_sha256": "fd1bbf4db6dcba484574068b0d6733fc33b2a81914d06cea715415715462a285", "ja": "ここにいる3人でユニットを組んで、\n活動をしてもらおうと考えている。", "zh": "我在考虑让在这里的3人组成一个组合，开展活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "0ed313f66d60d7e9b755eb999f7c3613ca7b4f4020c95537063b2059816833b5", "ja": "私たちで……ユニットを……？", "zh": "我们……组成……偶像组合……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_intro_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "1c11c69a65b0c99bb623a58e757bc9166df90fd8e63cda0e7ee93a821dc39c85", "ja": "……これは、この765プロライブ劇場で\n今日、これから始まる……私たちの物語。", "zh": "……这是从今天起，即将在\n这座765艺剧场拉开序幕的……属于我们的故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
